	(text "DESIGN REVIEW NOTES\nPin 1 has priority when both appliance inputs are present; blocking diodes prevent cross-feed.\nAP63205 output is nominal +5V and requires source headroom; validate all eight source states current-limited.\nUSB-C VBUS is isolated from appliance input; verify enumeration and no backfeed on prototype.\nU9/U10 QOD pin 5: NC. DNP/exclude states and source metadata are retained."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
